    {
      "text": "my God, and I will prepare him an habitation, Ex. 15:2. That prepareth his heart to seek God, 2 Chr. 30:19. prepare your brethren, 2 Chr. 35:6. Ezra had prepared his heart to seek the law, Ezra 7:10. thou wilt prepare their heart, Ps. 10:17. Thou preparest a table before me in the presence of mine enemies, Ps. 23:5. Prepare ye the way of the Lord, Isa. 40:3 (Matt. 3:3; Mark 1:3; Luke 3:4; 1 Ne. 10:8; Alma 7:9; D&C 45:9; 65:1, 3). prepare the way, take up the stumblingblock, Isa. 57:14. prepare ye the way of the people, Isa. 62:10. what he hath prepared for him that waiteth for him, Isa. 64:4 (1 Cor. 2:9). prepare to meet thy God, O Israel, Amos 4:12. Lord hath prepared a sacrifice, Zeph. 1:7. messenger, and he shall prepare the way before me, Mal. 3:1 (Matt. 11:10; Mark 1:2; Luke 7:27).",
